@startuml cfg_QuotaService_reserve
title Control Flow Graph — QuotaService.reserve (UC-17), V(G) = 5
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #999999
}

state "1: points = orderPoints(lines)" as N1
state "2: slotId = ensureExists(date, start)" as N2
state "3: points == 0 ?" as D3 #F5F5F5
state "4: return Reservation(slotId, 0)" as N4
state "5: defaultQuota = settings.get()" as N5
state "6: held = tryHold(date, start, points, defaultQuota)" as N6
state "7: held.isPresent() ?" as D7 #F5F5F5
state "8: return Reservation(held, points)" as N8
state "9: slot = find(date, start)" as N9
state "10: slot có dòng ?" as D10 #F5F5F5
state "11: throw IllegalStateException" as N11
state "12: points > slot.quota(defaultQuota) ?" as D12 #F5F5F5
state "13: throw ORDER_TOO_LARGE" as N13
state "14: throw SLOT_FULL" as N14
state "X: thoát" as X

[*] --> N1
N1 --> N2
N2 --> D3
D3 --> N4 : đúng (P1)
D3 --> N5 : sai
N5 --> N6
N6 --> D7
D7 --> N8 : đúng (P2)
D7 --> N9 : sai
N9 --> D10
D10 --> N11 : không có (P3)
D10 --> D12 : có
D12 --> N13 : đúng (P4)
D12 --> N14 : sai (P5)
N4 --> X
N8 --> X
N11 --> X
N13 --> X
N14 --> X
X --> [*]

note right of D7
  Nút 6 là câu UPDATE có điều kiện:
  điều kiện trong SQL được phủ ở
  WHITE_BOX_QUOTA.md mục 5.
end note
@enduml
